    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TREAT PATIENTS WITH VARYING SYMPTOMS AND CONDITIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/4018a20f736cc50398140ca36cc18524.poster.avif?t=1739548046\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/4018a20f736cc50398140ca36cc18524.gif?t=1739548046\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat a range of locals throughout the day. Pay close attention to their statements and medical conditions to figure out what treatment to prescribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDY PHYSICIAN'S GUIDEBOOK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/f58572632bb1a27c148c8f86e8247ef3.poster.avif?t=1739548046\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/f58572632bb1a27c148c8f86e8247ef3.apng?t=1739548046\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=362 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the provided guidebook to diagnose and prescribe patients accurately based on their symptoms and medical conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PATIENT REGISTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/d91618b229c2e72e170b01c0ba668fd8.poster.avif?t=1739548046\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/d91618b229c2e72e170b01c0ba668fd8.apng?t=1739548046\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=366 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the patient register to choose who you treat throughout the day. Shape your relations and reputation wisely among the unions and the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMISABLE 1-BIT PALETTES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/664c144941236bfe5d0c92401106f178.poster.avif?t=1739548046\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/664c144941236bfe5d0c92401106f178.gif?t=1739548046\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between various preset and custom color palettes to decide how the game looks. Choose what vibe you want to go with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES : </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by your decisions. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relationships with various unions in the city that will shape the gameplay. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 1-bit pixel art style with custom palette options. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TREAT PATIENTS WITH VARYING SYMPTOMS AND CONDITIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/4018a20f736cc50398140ca36cc18524.poster.avif?t=1739548046\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/4018a20f736cc50398140ca36cc18524.gif?t=1739548046\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat a range of locals throughout the day. Pay close attention to their statements and medical conditions to figure out what treatment to prescribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDY PHYSICIAN'S GUIDEBOOK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/f58572632bb1a27c148c8f86e8247ef3.poster.avif?t=1739548046\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/f58572632bb1a27c148c8f86e8247ef3.apng?t=1739548046\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=362 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the provided guidebook to diagnose and prescribe patients accurately based on their symptoms and medical conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PATIENT REGISTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/d91618b229c2e72e170b01c0ba668fd8.poster.avif?t=1739548046\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688430/extras/d91618b229c2e72e170b01c0ba668fd8.apng?t=1739548046\" class=\"bb_img\" width=61